        "Id": "efce0022-d4e5-4553-8b99-7eeb56fe5076",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Censor Part 1",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102728746062",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 335ce4e7-36bb-45cd-aa24-18564d48ed4e).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Your destination is the Sanguine Fashion show in Paris, France. Your target Sheikh Salman Al-Ghazali. It&apos;s believed that the entire Al-Ghazali family works for the infamous Vermont serial killer, The Censor, who was responsible for the death of one of our agents, Frank Schmit. You also must eliminate his undercover operatives, as we can&apos;t risk this being reported to the Censor, and a manhunt for the culprit commencing. Good luck 47.",
